Vectrex_MiSTer Licensing
========================

This repository contains components under multiple licenses. The notice in
each source file is authoritative and is not replaced by this summary.

The MiSTer integration and files marked with
"SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later" are available under version 2 of
the GNU General Public License or, at your option, any later version. See
licenses/GPL-2.0.txt.

JT49 and rtl/pause.v are available under GPL-3.0-or-later. rtl/via6522.vhd
states GPL version 3. See their source headers and licenses/GPL-3.0.txt. The
vendored JT49 tree also retains its own rtl/jt49/LICENSE file.

Dar's Vectrex and SP0256 VHDL sources retain their original educational-use
and redistribution notices. The MC6809 and other imported modules retain
their own source notices and terms. Nothing in this repository-level summary
relicenses those files.

The bundled Vectorblade, Telengard and Neon Hawk demo ROMs and original game
artwork retain their authors' rights and are included with permission. They are
not covered by the FPGA source-code licenses.
